"Restore stock icons for all %lld apps?" = "恢复全部 %lld 个 App 的原厂图标？";
"The custom icon is removed from the bundle and Livery stops tracking %@. The icon file stays in the library folder." = "自定义图标会从 bundle 中移除，Livery 停止追踪 %@。图标文件仍保留在资料库文件夹里。";
