"Allow Livery in the background" = "允许 Livery 在后台运行";
"System Settings › General › Login Items & Extensions › Allow in the Background. Turn on Livery." = "系统设置 › 通用 › 登录项与扩展 › 允许在后台运行。打开 Livery。";
"Register helper" = "注册 helper";
"Open Login Items" = "打开登录项";
"Let the helper manage apps" = "允许 helper 管理 App";
"Ask macOS" = "询问 macOS";
"Open App Management" = "打开 App 管理";
"Check again" = "再次检查";
"Done" = "完成";
"Approved" = "已批准";
"Waiting for the switch" = "等待打开开关";
"Not registered yet" = "尚未注册";
"Not needed: no app here is owned by root" = "不需要：这里没有 root 所有的 App";
"After step 1" = "先完成第 1 步";
"Helper starting…" = "helper 启动中…";
"Checking…" = "检查中…";
"Ask macOS puts Livery on the list under System Settings › Privacy & Security › App Management, or shows an approval dialog. Make sure the Livery switch there is on. The helper lives inside Livery, so this one switch covers both." = "“询问 macOS”会把 Livery 加进系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › App 管理的列表，或弹出批准对话框。确认那里 Livery 的开关是打开的。helper 就在 Livery 里面，所以这一个开关同时覆盖两者。";
"Every app on this Mac is writable by you, so the helper has nothing to do." = "这台 Mac 上的每个 App 你都有权写入，helper 无事可做。";
